  "description": "“在意空气”（Air Matters）是我经常使用的空气质量 app。使用它的空气质量历史数据，我能从中看出一些有趣的规律。",
  "body_html": "<p>“在意空气”（Air Matters）是我经常使用的空气质量 app。使用它的空气质量历史数据，我能从中看出一些有趣的规律。</p><p>1. 看看下面对最近一个月北京 pm10 数据的分析（图 1），你能从中看出什么样的规律？</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oTtt!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9dc8e8cb-cc70-4c91-834c-eaf2c795860a_380x640.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oTtt!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9dc8e8cb-cc70-4c91-834c-eaf2c795860a_380x640.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oTtt!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9dc8e8cb-cc70-4c91-834c-eaf2c795860a_380x640.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oTtt!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9dc8e8cb-cc70-4c91-834c-eaf2c795860a_380x640.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oTtt!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9dc8e8cb-cc70-4c91-834c-eaf2c795860a_380x640.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oTtt!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9dc8e8cb-cc70-4c91-834c-eaf2c795860a_380x640.jpeg\" width=\"380\" height=\"640\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/9dc8e8cb-cc70-4c91-834c-eaf2c795860a_380x640.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quo